A 309 | Miran. This starts an escort to the excavation site.
C 309 @ Loch Modan, 52.2, 69.4 | Walk with Miran. Dark Iron dwarves ambush the cart on the way: let them come to you, drop Stoneclaw Totem and kill them one at a time. Miran must survive.
T 309 | Prospector Ironband at the excavation camp

# ---------- Norric Lochthane and Dun Algaz ----------
T 94494 @ Loch Modan, 41.9, 19.0 | Ghost Wolf back around the south end of the loch, through Thelsamar and north. Norric Lochthane lives in the house on the north-west shore, just before the dam.
A 94495 @ Loch Modan, 41.9, 19.0 | Norric Lochthane
T 468 | Mountaineer Rockgar guards the Dun Algaz tunnel in the north-west corner of Loch Modan (25.4, 10.4)
A 455 | Mountaineer Rockgar
C 455 | Follow the road through the Dun Algaz tunnels into the Wetlands. Dragonmaw Scouts (19-20) and Grunts (20-21) stand along the road and in the side camps: kill 8 Scouts and 6 Grunts on the way through. They hit hard for your level: one at a time, Earthbind Totem for runners, Healing Wave between pulls. Whatever is missing you can finish in segment 7.

# ---------- Wetlands: Hervdana Saegrund ----------
T 94495 @ Wetlands, 65.7, 76.4 | Where the road leaves the hills, turn east and follow the foot of the southern cliffs to the waterfalls that drop from the Stonewrought Dam. Hervdana Saegrund lives in a cave beneath the falls (65.7, 76.4). Mosshide Gnolls and Mongrels (20-22) roam the marsh on the way and Dark Iron Insurgents (18-19) stand near the cave: go around what you can in Ghost Wolf.
A 94497 @ Wetlands, 65.7, 76.4 | Hervdana Saegrund
C 94497 @ Wetlands, 65.7, 76.4 | Go down to the pool at the bottom of the waterfalls, right below her cave, and use the Empty Brown Waterskin at the water.
T 94497 @ Wetlands, 65.7, 76.4 | Hervdana Saegrund
A 94499 @ Wetlands, 65.7, 76.4 | Hervdana Saegrund. The Empty Red Waterskin is filled at Stonewatch Falls in Redridge in the next segment: keep it in your bags.
H Thelsamar | Hearthstone back to the inn
